    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 34 Orwell Woods to the market. An attractive semi-detached bungalow recently upgraded including new bathrooms and kitchen and deceptively spacious accommodation throughout. Situated in this much sought after development of houses and bungalows, built in the 1980’s and situated off Orwell Park with green area to front and pedestrian access to Dartry Road. \r\n\r\nWonderfully proportioned, bright and airy accommodation throughout. Set in low maintenance paved front and rear gardens with a westerly aspect to rear and off street parking to front.  \r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance lobby, large living/dining to the front with floor to ceiling bay window overlooking the front of the property. Kitchen with a wide range of modern gloss kitchen units, high quality integrated appliances door to side and breakfast bar seating. Off the inner hallway is the hot press, closet and bathroom – newly renovated with bath, shower attachment, w.c and whb.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property is the principle bedroom with wall to wall wardrobe, wood flooring and picture window overlooking garden and door to rear garden. There is an ensuite showerroom off with shower, w.c, vanity whb with storage and medicine cabinet. Bedroom 2 also a spacious double has built in wardrobes and study area. \r\n\r\nOutside is parking to the front and side access. Low maintenance paved garden to rear with mature hedging and plants. Within the development is green open space and pedestrian gate to Dartry Road. \r\n\r\nOrwell Woods is a small exclusive development positioned in a much sought after South Dublin location with an array of local shopping facilities on Rathmines Road Upper and  Rathgar village. With easy access to the villages of Rathmines and Ranelagh with their wide selection of shops, restaurants, cinemas, bars etc. Amenities in the area are in abundance with Palmerston Park, Milltown Golf Club and Dodder Linear Park on your doorstep.  \r\n\r\nThe location is within walking distance to the LUAS and a number of bus routes linking into the city centre and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Lobby \r\nLaminate floor, glazed door to \r\n\r\nDining/Lounge \r\nLaminate floor throughout, gas fire with marble surround and bay window. \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nWide range of modern gloss kitchen units, undermount sink unit, high quality integrated appliances, built in hob with extractor fan, quartz worktop, upstand and backsplash. Breakfast bar seating finished with a laminate floor, subway tiled wall and door to side. \r\n\r\nInner hallway \r\nHot press, closet, access to attic and laminate floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nWall to wall built in wardrobe and laminate floor. \r\nEnsuite\r\nShower, vanity whb with storage, w.c, radiator, tiled floor and part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nBuilt in wardrobes, laminate floor, built in desk with storage and shelving \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, shower attachment, w.c, whb, shavers socket, radiator, tiled floor and part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nPaved off street parking to the front with side entrance. Paved low maintenance garden to the rear with a westerly aspect."
      },
      {
